  "body": "## Change and scope\n\nIn the five-source common-B mutable-source alphabet of [#1898](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1898), every restored straight-line word with **exactly seven queries** needs **at least six source XORs**. The bound is sharp: the path-lowered champion `(0,1,2,6,12,24,16,0)` attains `7 Q / 82 R / 6 X` (abstract tariff **442** at `(b,a,x)=(38,2,2)`).\n\n| X length | Min interaction components | Query floor `5+c` | Admits `Q=7`? |\n|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| \u22642 | \u22654 | \u22659 | no |\n| 4 or 5 | 3 | 8 | no |\n| **6** | **2** | **7** | **yes (sharp)** |\n\nThis closes the non-path XOR floor left open by the path-lowered `mutable-source-789q-invoice` OQ1: already `X\u22645` is impossible at `Q=7`, so `X\u22642` with `R=82` is impossible. Graph digests for lengths 0\u20136 match open [#2455](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2455)'s published census (that PR proves `X\u22658` at **six** queries).\n\n**Scoped obstruction with sharp attainment; no new kappa.** No claim that seven-query words cannot undercut tariff 436 by lowering `R` while keeping `X\u22656`. Leave-alone through [#2593](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2593) and pending `mutable-source-789q-invoice` were not reopened.\n\n## Result\n\nPackage: `research/seven-query-xor-floor/`.\nTip: `14fd0c3177b51f8d17e6fa8ba7ed3ee81989285a`.\n\nExact: `Q=7` forces `min_X=6`; `X\u22645` blocked; champion attains sharpness.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -I -B research/seven-query-xor-floor/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -O -B research/seven-query-xor-floor/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/seven-query-xor-floor/independent.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/seven-query-xor-floor/test_package.py\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/seven-query-xor-floor\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n```text\nPASS_SEVEN_QUERY_XOR_FLOOR Q=7 min_X=6 sharp X<=5 blocked answers_789q_oq1 no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_SEVEN_QUERY_XOR_FLOOR min_X=6 floors_block_X_le_5 ... tariff=442 controls=2\nPASS_SEVEN_QUERY_XOR_FLOOR_PACKAGE_TESTS groups=6\nPASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE research/seven-query-xor-floor outcome=completed\n```\n\nDefault verify is read-only. Admission uses `need()`; `-O` also passes.\n\n## Overlap and credit\n\nClosest priors: [#2455](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2455) (`X\u22658` at Q=6), [#1898](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1898), path-lowered 789q invoice (OQ1). Freestanding package; no competing open PR on this claim at refresh.\n\nCredit the mutable-source / PR1898 / PR2455 lineage. Prepared by Wentao Li ([VictorLiwentao](https://github.com/VictorLiwentao), [@Is__Victor](https://x.com/Is__Victor)) with substantial AI assistance, under Apache-2.0.",
